      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "dbbf0ccf-0e89-52c7-a2fe-17a72a3b15f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Moira Kelly, D. B. Sweeney, Matthew Broderick, James Earl Jones, Jeremy Irons, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Nathan Lane, Ernie Sabella, Rowan Atkinson, Robert Guillaume, Madge Sinclair, Whoopi Goldberg, Cheech Marin, Jim Cummings\n- Films: The Cutting Edge, Chaplin, The Lion King, The Lion King II: Simba's Pride\n- Television Series: The West Wing\n- Roles: Dorothy Day, Mandy Hampton, Nala, Hetty Kelly, Oona O'Neill\n\nFacts:\n- In the film \"The Cutting Edge,\" Moira Kelly plays a rich, spoiled figure skater who is paired with a has-been ice hockey player played by D. B. Sweeney for Olympic figure skating.\n- In the film \"Chaplin,\" Moira Kelly plays both Hetty Kelly and Oona O'Neill.\n- In the film \"The Lion King,\" Moira Kelly is part of an ensemble voice cast that also includes Matthew Broderick, James Earl Jones, Jeremy Irons, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Nathan Lane, Ernie Sabella, Rowan Atkinson, Robert Guillaume, Madge Sinclair, Whoopi Goldberg, Cheech Marin, and Jim Cummings.\n- Moira Kelly voices Nala, Simba's love interest, in \"The Lion King\" and its sequel \"The Lion King II: Simba's Pride.\"\n- Moira Kelly played Dorothy Day in \"Entertaining Angels: The Dorothy Day Story.\"\n- Moira Kelly played White House media consultant Mandy Hampton in the first season of the television series \"The West Wing.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
